xt></transliteration></transliterations><songwriters><songwriter>장혜영</songwriter><songwriter>張惠英</songwriter><songwriter>JANG HEA YOUNG</songwriter><songwriter>李洋</songwriter><songwriter>Yang Lee</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="1:09.070"><div begin="4.370" end="1:09.070"><p begin="4.370" end="10.514" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4.370" end="4.528">오</span><span begin="4.528" end="4.760">데</span><span begin="4.760" end="5.308">트</span> <span begin="6.254" end="6.546">나</span><span begin="6.546" end="6.778">랑</span> <span begin="6.778" end="7.250">눈</span><span begin="7.250" end="7.656">사</span><span begin="7.656" end="8.114">람</span> <span begin="8.114" end="8.384">만</span><span begin="8.384" end="8.804">들</span><span begin="8.804" end="10.514">자</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">奥黛塔 快陪我去堆个雪人吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">オデット 雪だるま作りましょ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Dear Odette, come and build a snowman with me</span></p><p begin="11.728" end="17.264" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="11.728" end="11.984">아</span><span begin="11.984" end="12.418">님</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">汽</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="12.418" end="12.666">기</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">車</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="12.666" end="12.890">차</span></span></span> <span begin="12.890" end="13.154">타</span><span begin="13.154" end="13.580">고</span> <span begin="14.024" end="14.248">스</span><span begin="14.248" end="14.504">네</span><span begin="14.504" end="14.976">즈</span><span begin="14.976" end="15.350">나</span><span begin="15.350" end="15.876">야</span> <span begin="15.876" end="16.086">돌</span><span begin="16.086" end="17.264">자</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">或是跳上火车 绕着至冬跑一圈</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">列車に飛び乗って 雪国を一周～</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Or hop on a train, roaming Snezhnaya with glee</span></p><p begin="17.684" end="26.512" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="17.684" end="17.916">맨</span><span begin="17.916" end="18.126">날</span> <span begin="18.126" end="18.560">나</span><span begin="18.560" end="19.056">랑</span> <span begin="19.056" end="19.484">안</span> <span begin="19.484" end="19.934">놀</span><span begin="19.934" end="20.210">아</span><span begin="20.210" end="20.668">줘</span><span begin="20.668" end="21.096">서</span> <span begin="21.366" end="21.592">물</span><span begin="21.592" end="21.802">고</span><span begin="21.802" end="22.198">기</span><span begin="22.198" end="22.634">한</span><span begin="22.634" end="23.076">테</span> <span begin="23.076" end="23.534">노</span><span begin="23.534" end="23.886">래</span><span begin="23.886" end="24.238">하</span><span begin="24.238" end="26.512">네</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你好久都没陪我玩 我只能对着鱼唱歌</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">お魚と歌うわ あなたがいないから</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">It&apos;s been ages since you&apos;ve come to play, I&apos;ve been singing to the fish all day</span></p><p begin="28.673" end="41.989" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">觀</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="28.673" end="29.093">관</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">客</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="29.093" end="29.483">객</span></span></span><span begin="29.483" end="29.955">이</span> <span begin="29.955" end="30.405">있</span><span begin="30.405" end="30.653">다</span> <span begin="30.653" end="31.087">해</span><span begin="31.087" end="31.763">도</span> <span begin="32.243" end="32.445">나</span><span begin="32.445" end="32.685">는</span> <span begin="32.685" end="33.105">언</span><span begin="33.105" end="33.547">제</span><span begin="33.547" end="34.021">나</span> <span begin="34.021" end="34.275">외</span><span begin="34.275" end="34.965">로</span><span begin="34.965" end="35.467">워</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">時</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="35.894" end="36.314">시</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">間</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="36.314" end="37.200">간</span></span></span><span begin="37.200" end="37.642">만</span> <span begin="37.642" end="38.138">똑</span><span begin="38.138" end="38.561">딱</span><span begin="39.011" end="39.905">똑</span><span begin="39.905" end="41.989">딱</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虽然舞台并不空 但你知道我总是很孤单 看时光滴答流转</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">舞台は満席でも あたしはひとりぼっち 時計を見つめるだけ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Though the stage is far from empty, you know I&apos;m feeling so alone, just watching as the time ticks by</span></p><p begin="43.151" end="49.115" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="43.151" end="43.557">똑</span><span begin="43.557" end="43.985">딱</span> <span begin="45.019" end="45.371">똑</span><span begin="45.371" end="45.799">딱</span> <span begin="46.797" end="47.209">똑</span><span begin="47.209" end="49.115">딱</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">滴答 滴答 滴答</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">チクタク、チクタク、チクタク</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Tick-tock, tick-tock, tick-tock</span></p><p begin="50.427" end="56.239" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="50.427" end="50.817">똑</span><span begin="50.817" end="51.207">딱</span> <span begin="52.205" end="52.639">똑</span><span begin="52.639" end="53.051">딱</span> <span begin="54.019" end="54.469">똑</span><span begin="54.469" end="56.239">딱</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">滴答 滴答 滴答</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">チクタク、チクタク、チクタク</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Tick-tock, tick-tock, tick-tock</span></p><p begin="58.811" end="1:09.070" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="58.811" end="59.029">오</span><span begin="59.029" end="59.315">데</span><span begin="59.315" end="59.907">트</span> <span begin="1:00.935" end="1:01.129">나</span><span begin="1:01.129" end="1:01.331">랑</span> <span begin="1:01.331" end="1:01.767">눈</span><span begin="1:01.767" end="1:02.531">사</span><span begin="1:02.531" end="1:03.551">람</span> <span begin="1:03.551" end="1:04.497">만</span><span begin="1:04.999" end="1:05.405">들</span><span begin="1:05.405" end="1:09.070">자</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">奥黛塔 快陪我去堆个雪人吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">オデット 雪だるま作りましょ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Dear Odette, come and build a snowman with me</span></p></div></body></tt>